      "status": "done",
      "body": [
        "In autumn 2021 I ran a series of audiovisual experiments on interactive and generative installation content. It ended at around twenty pieces, each examining a different interaction method — voice input, motion tracking, audio-driven synchronisation.",
        "Three workstations: an MSI Creator for real-time visuals in Notch VFX, a laptop generating audio in Ableton Live, and an HP NUC running TouchDesigner for input and system integration. Everything spoke OSC.",
        "Eight pieces from the series: beat-driven fluid simulations played live on faders; sound and generative systems that follow the hand through Leap Motion; fragments, particles and spheres that scatter on gesture; gesture-driven audio and smoke with typography built into the scene; generative visuals and sound performed live on faders and pads of an Arturia BeatStep."
      ],
