      "status": "done",
      "body": [
        "Mardini is an annual creative challenge run by SideFX, the makers of Houdini: 31 days, 31 works, each day a new prompt that pushes toward a different technique, tool or idea.",
        "I set myself a few rules. One piece a day, no batching and nothing made in advance. No AI: everything built by hand in Houdini. Every piece explores one specific technique or system. Both stills and animation. An honest progression from familiar tools into new territory.",
        "All 31 days done: 17 images and 14 animations, from Plant, Animal and Aquatic in the first days to Motion Blur and Refract at the end."
      ],
